    {
      "id": "agent-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 405,
      "y": 381.0,
      "width": 370,
      "height": 158,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 8,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 8,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Mida agent\n(a small program in TrustLayer's repo)\n\nRuns these checks itself, in order:\n1  Ask TrustLayer: may I act? (no: stop)\n2  Ask Mida: the owner's brief (revoked: stop)\n3  Does the amount fit the level's limit?\n4  Pay the recipient\n5  Write a receipt into Mida",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": "agent",
      "originalText": "Mida agent\n(a small program in TrustLayer's repo)\n\nRuns these checks itself, in order:\n1  Ask TrustLayer: may I act? (no: stop)\n2  Ask Mida: the owner's brief (revoked: stop)\n3  Does the amount fit the level's limit?\n4  Pay the recipient\n5  Write a receipt into Mida",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
